Police Station: Civil Lines    Jila: Kanpur Nagar
Report No. 0389/2026     Date: 21.05.2026
Sir, main Mohammad Aslam, walad Abdul Rasheed, mohalla Colonelganj ka rehne wala hoon. Mera contact number 9450 667 788 hai. Raat ko 20-05-2026 ko hum log shaadi mein gaye the. Wapas aakar dekha to taala tuta hua tha aur almari se 8 tola sona aur nakad 2.5 lakh rupaye gayab the. Mujhe apne kiraayedaar Pappu Nishad par shak hai. Padosi Geeta Devi ne raat 1 baje Pappu ko ek Splendor bike UP 78 BT 2345 par jaate dekha tha. Kripya karyawahi karein. Dhara 457, 380 IPC lagayi jaye.
Sub Inspector Om Prakash jaanch karenge.
